Z||000017||Eric||02-12-2001||12:02 AM||||Guinness!  Guinness!  Guinness!  <BR>I like to buy an eight pack, get an old steel bucket, dump them all in there, and let it sit in the sun for a week or two.  Then I take out the liquid part, and dump the rest in a pint glass.  It tastes just like the Guinness in Ireland.||||reg||1
